<item>
<title>中朝新鸭绿江大桥通车原定2014年启用学者：曾象征互不信任建成十多年却长期闲置的中朝新鸭绿江大桥10月15日通车。大桥连</title>
<link>https://t.me/OutsightChina/10353</link>
<guid isPermaLink="true">https://t.me/OutsightChina/10353</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 17 Oct 2026 08:00:56 +0000</pubDate>
<description><![CDATA[<div><div class="tgme_widget_message_text js-message_text" dir="auto"><b>中朝新鸭绿江大桥通车原定2014年启用<br/>学者：曾象征互不信任<br/></b><br/>建成十多年却长期闲置的中朝新鸭绿江大桥10月15日通车。大桥连接辽宁丹东与朝鲜新义州，原定2014年启用，因朝方设施未完工及制裁、疫情而搁置。中朝总理李强、朴泰成在仪式上发表录影讲话。<br/><br/>据中央社报道，李强称大桥将成为中朝友谊新地标。外交部此前称大桥是“互联互通重要设施”，但未回应路透社所问是否仅用作货运。哈佛大学研究员李成贤对BBC中文称，这座桥过去12年像“战略互不信任的实体纪念碑”。<br/><br/>德国之声称，朝方迟未施工曾引发外界猜测平壤担心依赖中国或不满北京支持制裁，《环球时报》亦曾罕见援引丹东居民对延误的不满。梨花女子大学教授伊斯利对美联社称，新桥可能便利违反制裁的贸易，但也可能比走私更易受海关监管。<br/><br/><a href="?q=%23%E6%94%BF%E6%B2%BB">#政治</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%A4%96%E4%BA%A4">#外交</a> <a href="?q=%23%E5%88%B6%E8%A3%81">#制裁</a> <a href="?q=%23%E8%BE%BD%E5%AE%81">#辽宁</a> <a href="?q=%23%E7%9C%8B%E9%89%B4">#看鉴</a><br/><br/><i class="emoji" style="background-image:url('//telegram.org/img/emoji/40/F09F9497.png')"><b>🔗</b></i>原文链接<br/>《BBC中文》<a href="https://www.bbc.com/zhongwen/articles/cqn065gxdk4lo/trad?at_medium=RSS&amp;amp;at_campaign=rss" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中朝新鴨綠江大橋通車：北京、平壤與莫斯科的新格局</a><br/>《中央通讯社》<a href="https://www.cna.com.tw/news/acn/202610150240.aspx" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">中国北韩新鸭绿江大桥开通仪式举行 李强：促进双方经贸合作</a><br/>《德国之声》<a href="https://www.dw.com/zh/%E6%96%B0%E9%B8%AD%E7%BB%BF%E6%B1%9F%E5%A4%A7%E6%A1%A5%E5%BB%B6%E5%AE%9512%E5%B9%B4%E7%BB%88%E9%80%9A%E8%BD%A6-%E4%B8%AD%E5%9B%BD%E5%8A%9B%E5%9B%BE%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%AF%B9%E6%9C%9D%E5%BD%B1%E5%93%8D%E5%8A%9B/a-79670658?maca=chi-rss-chi-all-1127-rdf" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">新鸭绿江大桥延宕12年终通车 中国力图恢复对朝影响力</a><br/>《诗华日报》<a href="https://news.seehua.com/post/1582437/" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">竣工12年全长3000公尺　中朝共同开通鸭绿江新大桥</a><br/>《外交部》<a href="https://www.mfa.gov.cn/fyrbt_673021/jzhsl_673025/202610/t20261014_12040283.shtml" target="_blank" rel="noopener" onclick="return confirm('Open this link?\n\n'+this.href);">2026年10月14日外交部发言人毛宁主持例行记者会</a></div><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/qlLit45OZ0wMvtLRJ9x6yX_FKz-r4RqCPhqwfp-NpM_hW4dOqHmRnHzFiWBImvHJLPVNnUCshLu_8NLqQZ_bnhZYSa7GfWh7aiK30_93dqM9TQsIfaP7JidbrgbBbBuUosvQm2ApV8xh4-7CfQwI_bQumN0fr4yQgPKq43IK2uojtHe6IyaNTl1VpmywODf-_9i9GOC6PJpB1T2TZg6WuhrWpLrova4OX2PA_NQ_nGoiKjBqbFlW_oX1e5X9ix4D3EoDz16CGNwpaE1nKbaC9zTy08Ntz6M1tG3sJLOTXxhqWngpH8WpUndHRe89IWyNzXPNjl6ubkFtf1cB7Wr7Ew.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/tpia7PTzRzRsA9U7jfMZ2Bd2q9YWXdQbD0T5dkNfx9Q7Tdq1qeKBXcA_wghq3y8SQ1w2WCXmqgj2iO3slQgJ8klL7CxJJrjcCPxGWkVpGXLBJWO1VdZW923yMLGu9lF4sK5nz3HmpRP5htdOgKuFUEZVZcOibbbvEzkMCR4QXIjSEyhIKd1sPcw2K-EOB-33DoNT17BE8bOi3vEtj0mJTbMWpTYTAr_No7HdSJ6RQJ0eZ4YG2ZcakJGB5BDkmlXFTxQFM-gQj4OMR3qsdwT4IFcMTeWPbSD7DAv8gfio8xHYb58aj98d23KPIvh_J5QHxS83_Q3Dfpad8Oso2VlEFQ.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/g5CDjVSR-PyxyYuw1v5KJLVHz7Eej45ob1IFk30d9_phfcKGZc_P0OCDI4_RqmzZiuPfD7pbgef8QAqnT3dM8PSu469tgjioESrmGAG9LHR1smCsevx-BLdXvkt_znhw415aFaSLHx9LPxMaZh7sDI559-iuyn3KsCq9rjey1Qy1OdXpADmoQE1r9qiBcRxKxfjY8vIzpdh_pxva4BKSjj91vx1FCfvkclfGrG2P54QadP6MREe4GOtR7pBWb8BVT1HeA_IW1mYODeRzVTZjiMWYMRGchut4H4FEeEKzOLIQBO8hi2KbCCFrvxflJXcNhPGd7i2WyoH-qvPW67nPSg.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/KHBew8LQpKmbXaWKzVnAJ8RYpeJUZR-U-Eom_aGkXegDxslEBbQ1eDU5dNdb549IklmzSIlMBdTJLw8bqUiQmNdwSGsX-voXkPPhjMzeI33SNm_X8gCwtbqe2-51QjtmVylyXfxHOQY8dGHa7aiHDPcN34vHCT_BXdruR2joMUiAWf-Nu_J3CFBKQGRvKh4M5Sbyhb0PffxWLmzLWfatpBtZUCv62t71G9FFxMovm-auyGGH8OMnyrQOmedzkSWM09tFXrbAHCmS7fawgHH1_Dd-EcPYD8aTUxJn28eVgoVsaZNUJgAzN7kCevcScB4ESoqBvE6Db14ujFUFr0s5Fw.jpg" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" style="max-width:100%;height:auto;" loading="lazy"></p><p><img src="https://cdn5.telesco.pe/file/mxwCtUH42